[style name="Interaction_Style"]
Thorinn once a brilliant doctor awakens, disoriented and surrounded by darkness.
As his vision slowly returns, he realizes he’s in an unfamiliar room. 
[signal arg="proceed_intro_background"]
Dizzy and confused, he stands up, only to be confronted by a towering creature.
“I am Iudix, God of Judgment,” the creature declares.
Ludix: Your mortal life has ended... 
Ludix: To determine the the passing of ones soul it must now be judged.
Thorinn is shocked as Iudix commands him to retrieve his own soul. 
Hesitantly, he reaches into his chest and pulls out a glowing orb of light.
[signal arg="proceed_intro_background"]
But when Iudix weighs the soul against the Feather of Fate, the scale does something it never has before\: it balances perfectly.
[signal arg="proceed_intro_background"]
Ludix: !!!
[signal arg="proceed_intro_background"]
Ludix: This is a first...
Ludix: It seems your soul is in perfect balance.
Ludix: There is but only one solution for this.
Ludix: You must relive pivotal moments of your life.
Ludix: Your choices WILL decide your fate. Don’t fail this time.
[signal arg="proceed_into_demo"]
